{"title":"Stammfunktionen zuordnen","puid":"c-mat-11-analysis/cx3ef6","path":"/../c-mat-11-analysis/topic-08-04-integrationsregeln/block-01-potenzregel/level-06","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardDE","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"hint":{"label":"Hilfe","text":[{"text":"<m-yellow><t-yellow>&nbsp;Grundlagen&nbsp;</m-yellow></t-yellow>&nbsp;"},{"text":"Mit Hilfe der <b>Potenzregel</b> kann man die <b>Stammfunktion einer Potenzfunktion f</b> bestimmen.<br>Eine Stammfunktion von f wird wie folgt bestimmt: <br><mat center=true>f(x)=x^r &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;&nbsp;F(x)=1/(r+1)* x ^{ r+1}</mat><br><b>Beispiele:</b>"},{"text":" <br><mat center='true'>f(x)||=|| x^2 || &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;||F(x)||=1/(2+1)* x ^{ 2 +1}=1/3 x^{3}<br>f(x)||=|| x^{-4} || &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;||F(x)||=1/(-4+1) *x ^{ -4 +1}=-1/3 x^{-3}</mat>   "}]},"trainers":[{"trainer":"drawLines","instruction":{"text":"Verbinde jede Funktion mit ihrer korrekten Stammfunktion.","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"lines":4,"pointToPoint":true,"lsg":{"width":500},"colors":["rgba(66,165,245,1)","rgba(255,167,38,1)","rgba(236,64,122,1)","rgba(171,71,188,1)"],"shuffleAtoms":false,"atoms":{"lsg":"/../c-mat-11-analysis/topic-08-04-integrationsregeln/block-01-potenzregel/lsg/06/lineCombine-integration-01.lsg"}},{"trainer":"drawLines","instruction":{"text":"Verbinde jede Funktion mit ihrer korrekten Stammfunktion.","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"lines":4,"pointToPoint":true,"lsg":{"width":500},"colors":["rgba(66,165,245,1)","rgba(255,167,38,1)","rgba(236,64,122,1)","rgba(171,71,188,1)"],"shuffleAtoms":false,"atoms":{"lsg":"/../c-mat-11-analysis/topic-08-04-integrationsregeln/block-01-potenzregel/lsg/06/lineCombine-integration-02.lsg"}}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Integrationsregeln","path":"/../c-mat-11-analysis/topic-08-04-integrationsregeln/topic","puid":"c-mat-11-analysis/30q4xw"},"par